---
const points = [
  {
    label: 'The question',
    title: 'Could a domain expert direct agentic teams to build a real system?',
    body: 'Flash started as a deliberately ambitious test. Android device management brings meaningful product, security, and operational constraints.',
  },
  {
    label: 'The method',
    title: 'Build quickly, then make the work answerable to scrutiny.',
    body: 'LLM agents accelerated implementation, while architecture review, security hardening, tests, and deployment work made the resulting system something others can inspect and challenge.',
  },
  {
    label: 'The result',
    title: 'A working proof of concept, shared in the open.',
    body: 'The repository includes the application, tests, deployment guidance, API documentation, and licensing context. Together, they document the workflow behind the proof of concept.',
  },
];
---

<section id="case-study" class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-gray-950 text-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-primary-300">WHY FLASH EXISTS</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">
        A technical exercise in LLM-assisted development, with the receipts left visible.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-300">
        The point was never to declare traditional MDM dead. It was to test what changes when an experienced practitioner can work with agentic development teams — and where human judgement still matters most.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
      {points.map((point, index) => (
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-300">0{index + 1} · {point.label}</p>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold leading-snug">{point.title}</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-300">{point.body}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
      <a href="https://bayton.org/blog/2026/03/mdm-is-dead-long-live-ace/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-300 hover:text-primary-200 transition-colors">
        Read “MDM is Dead; Long Live ACE” <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
      <span class="hidden sm:block text-gray-600">|</span>
      <a href="https://github.com/jasonbayton/flash_mdm#readme" class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-300 hover:text-primary-200 transition-colors">
        Read the project README <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
